# Terraform
**/.terraform/
**/*.tfstate
**/*.tfstate.*
**/crash.log
**/crash.*.log
**/*.tfvars
!**/*.tfvars.example

# Local env files
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example

# Neovim plugin lockfile — churns on every :Lazy update
/.config/nvim/lazy-lock.json

# Synth drops per-tool MCP config, with absolute paths, into whatever repo it opens.
# Root-anchored so the tracked plugin and OpenCode configs still count.
/.mcp.json
/opencode.json
/.agents/
